      "notes": "Runtime is an immutable CI artifact that tracks gate_main (green+published main). host-track refresh promotes stable to that tip then installs. ~/.last-stack/{bin,skills,...} \u2192 artifacts/current. PATH links Class A + pickup bootstrap + Forge closeout tools (forge-api and friends) so routinesd (~/.local/bin first) never hits GC'd version pins and board-closeout can resolve Forge PRs. Never develop in the install; use a worktree. Also PATH-link last-stack-papercut-lifecycle-close, last-stack-kanban-file-pr, last-stack-kanban-decision-check, last-stack-kanban-done-when-eval, last-stack-json-capture, and last-stack-json-get so scheduled shells (routinesd PATH often ~/.local/bin-first without sourcing shell-prelude) resolve the lifecycle closer, the required Kind:pr filing helper, its settled-decision check, the non-PR DONE-WHEN evaluator, and the JSON stdout/stderr capture helpers the unsafe-inline-json hook recommends.",
      "safe_upgrade": {
        "post_install_phase": "after-cutover",
        "probes": [
          {"argv": ["bin/host-track", "--help"], "timeout_s": 15},
          {"argv": ["bin/host-track", "validate-registry"], "timeout_s": 30}
        ]
      }
